    "text": "Spot on, Nate at [05:37], when you mentioned how document processing is where the real boring-is-beautiful ROI lives, it hit right on what I’ve built for AP teams.\r\nInstead of generic document AI, I built a production-ready automated pipeline that handles end-to-end invoice processing:\r\n1. Polls invoices straight from Google Drive.\r\n2. OCR extracts line items and performs tax validation.\r\n3. Pulls the PO from Odoo and the GRN automatically.\r\n4. Runs a 3-way match for goods (or 2-way match for services).\r\n5. Generates a draft vendor bill if successful, with a human-in-the-loop safety net anywhere it encounters discrepancies or fails validation.\r\nIt completely takes manual data entry off the plates of AP teams just like you outlined. If anyone knows CFOs, accountants, or businesses struggling with manual invoicing who need this built or automated, I’m open for business and taking on leads. Let's connect!\"",
